@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 400
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Edit workspace settings
actor "Administrator" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "ProjectLayoutPage / ProjectHeaderView\nProjectFormDialog / WorkspaceForm" as page
  participant "IWorkspaceService / WorkspaceService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "WorkspacesController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "UpdateWorkspaceCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "Workspace" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Project actions > Edit project on any project tab (the header's actionRequested output; shown only with workspaces.manage)
page -> page : The layout's openDialog(Edit) opens ProjectFormDialog; fields and Save disabled; announce "Loading project"
page -> client : WorkspaceForm's workspaceResource reads GetWorkspaceQuery (GET /api/workspaces/{id}, authorized like any workspace read)
alt Read 404 (project deleted after the header loaded)
  client --> page : Resource status error (404)
  page -> page : No input to keep, so WorkspaceForm emits notFound at once; the dialog closes with NotFound; the layout navigates to /projects, which reads the list without the project, and shows the info toast "Community Hackathon 2026 has been deleted." through TOAST_SERVICE; no reference ID or Try again
else Read fails (500 with correlation ID, or no response)
  client --> page : Resource status error
  page --> actor : edit-load-failed: fields and Save stay disabled; alert announced, with the reference ID for a 500 (no response: none, and the shell's offline banner appears); focus Try again, which calls reload(); Cancel closes
else Read resolves
  client --> page : WorkspaceDetail with its version; the draft starts from it; focus Name
end
note right of page
  Only a resolved read continues below. The read-only
  Delivery mode field's Change delivery mode link emits
  changeModeRequested: the dialog closes with ChangeMode
  after the unsaved-changes check and the layout calls
  openDialog(ChangeMode) (change-delivery-mode slice).
end note
actor -> page : Change settings; Save changes
page -> page : Disable repeat submission; show saving progress; draftChange reports dirty and pending
page -> client : edit(UpdateWorkspaceCommand with the opened expectedVersion) returns a promise
client -> access : PUT /api/workspaces/{id}
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid, or expired JWT; inactive account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor: a 401 for the current session generation calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once
  client --> page : The promise rejects with the 401; nothing saved; sign-in reports the unsaved draft
else Collaborator (profile P: no workspace edits)
  access --> client : 403; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor calls SessionService.refreshCapabilities() (one in flight)
  client --> page : The promise rejects with the 403; forbidden state: keep the dialog and every value; explain that only administrators can save project settings; Save changes unavailable, so focus moves to the alert; no reference ID; nothing saved; controls follow currentSession
else Administrator
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send UpdateWorkspaceCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : Validation V: trimmed name 1-200; description <= 10,000; no mode field
  alt Invalid fields
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing saved
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : The promise rejects; show field errors; keep valid input; no Retry or reference ID; one field error focuses that field, which reads its error; several focus the linked error summary
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle UpdateWorkspaceCommand
    handler -> db : Load workspace and version (version guard only; no workspace lock)
    db --> handler : Workspace row or none
    alt Workspace missing (deleted meanwhile)
      handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing saved
      ctrl --> client : NotFound ProblemDetails
      client --> page : The promise rejects; deleted state: keep the attempted values; disable the fields and Save; the alert "This project no longer exists" is announced and becomes the dialog's description; focus Back to projects; no reference ID or Try again
      actor -> page : Back to projects (Cancel, Close, or Escape asks before discarding the kept values)
      page -> page : WorkspaceForm emits notFound; the dialog closes with NotFound; the layout navigates to /projects, which reads the list without the project, and shows the info toast "Community Hackathon 2026 has been deleted." through TOAST_SERVICE
    else Version differs from expectedVersion
      handler --> ctrl : L2-041 409 stale version; nothing saved
      ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails
      client --> page : The promise rejects with the stale 409
      page -> client : WorkspaceForm calls reload() on its workspace resource once (GET /api/workspaces/{id}, authorized as above)
      client --> page : Resource resolves with the latest WorkspaceDetail (a 404 instead shows the deleted state, as above)
      page -> page : Keep attempted values; show "Your edit" beside "Latest saved"; Reload latest replaces Save and receives focus; announce the alert; no resubmission
      opt Reload latest
        page -> page : Adopt the reloaded values and version; keep the comparison visible
        page --> actor : "Latest version loaded"; re-apply edits, then Save changes sends a new request
      end
    else Current version
      handler -> db : Check optional responsible lead still exists
      db --> handler : Lead row or none
      alt Selected lead no longer exists
        handler --> ctrl : 400 responsibleLeadId field error; nothing saved
        ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
        client --> page : The promise rejects; lead-missing: show the alert and field error; focus Responsible lead, which reads its error; no Retry or reference ID; keep every other value
      else Lead exists or cleared
        handler -> entity : L2-014 edit name, description, lead; mode unchanged
        entity --> handler : Updated workspace; version + 1
        handler -> db : L2-039 / L2-040 SaveChangesAsync: update guarded by expectedVersion with success audit; one transaction
        alt Version guard matches no row (racing save)
          db --> handler : Roll back update and audit
          handler --> ctrl : Same 409 stale version
          ctrl --> client : Conflict ProblemDetails
          client --> page : Same comparison flow as above; no resubmission
        else Restrictive lead FK rejects a racing lead deletion
          db --> handler : Roll back update and audit
          handler --> ctrl : Same 400 responsibleLeadId field error
          ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
          client --> page : The promise rejects; lead-missing as above; focus Responsible lead; keep every other value
        else Commit fails unexpectedly
          db --> handler : Roll back update and audit
          handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID
          ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-save claim
          client --> page : The promise rejects; failed state: announce the save-failed alert with reference ID; keep every value; Save changes keeps focus and retries only when pressed
        else Commit succeeds
          db --> handler : New committed version
          handler --> ctrl : 200 with SavedWorkspaceResult (id, new version, name)
          ctrl --> client : Success response
          client --> page : The promise resolves with SavedWorkspaceResult; WorkspaceForm emits saved; the dialog closes with Saved(SavedWorkspaceResult)
          page -> page : ProjectLayoutPage calls refresh() (revision + 1); ProjectHeaderView and the active tab's view reload their resources
          page --> actor : The layout shows the "Changes saved" toast naming the project through TOAST_SERVICE; focus returns to Project actions
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
opt No response to the save (timeout or network failure)
  client --> page : The save may have committed: keep the attempted values; the failed alert reads "We couldn't confirm whether your changes were saved" without a reference ID; WorkspaceForm calls reload() on its workspace resource once and emits unconfirmed, which the dialog relays, so the layout calls refresh() and the header and the active tab reread at once; Save resends only when pressed, and a save that did commit makes it meet the stale-version 409 and its comparison; because the first save may be the change it shows, the conflict alert then reads "The latest saved version is shown beside your entries." instead of "Your edits haven't been saved."; a 404 from the reread or the resent save shows the deleted state with the values kept, its alert reading only "Community Hackathon 2026 was deleted while you were editing." without "Your edits weren't saved"
end
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
